cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Topological Signatures of Knowledge and of Conflict in a Small Language Model
message: A negative result that survived four runs.
authors:
  - name: RATISS Labs
    city: Yaoundé
    country: CM
type: software
license: MIT
abstract: >
  Measures beta1(tau) of the residual-stream correlation graph of
  Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct across a 2x2 of knowledge and constraint.
  Knowledge has a robust topological signature (+0.0765, 20/25 layers).
  A conflict against a held belief does not: at matched surprise and matched
  answer length the contrast is -0.0162.
